      "message": "I want to explain this range selection.\n\nThe kalista fan_table at lines 449-456 is:\n\n0 up to 30% (was 26 C, now 32 C)\nfan_min up to 49% (was 40 C, now 40 C), and \nfan_max above 75% (was 58 C, now 50 C)\n\nIn particular, because the fan_table sets fan_max from 75% of the range (while most other boards set it from 98%), in order to practically have fan_max from 50 C, I set this parameter to 60 C.  (If I were to set 50 C, as on all other boards, then fan_max would start closer to 42 C.)",
